docs/tooling/cost.md:68:by this report and the build-time allocation promise. Stack-promoted lists and
docs/tooling/cost.md:69:allocation-free borrow/identity helpers do not allocate. Managed construction,
docs/tooling/cost.md:70:materialization, copy, growth, stable sorting scratch, compound-key lookup
